    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good high-level start. Can you get a bit more specific about the security side of things? Like, when we're talking about protecting against unauthorized access or \"bad actors\" trying to get into the client files, what are the specific technical advantages of these physical keys over traditional methods? I want to make sure I can explain the actual risk reduction to our partners.",
